Package: python3-updatedns
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Command-line cloud DNS utility and dynamic DNS client
 Manages DNS A and AAAA records with any DNS provider that Apache libcloud
 supports, and can keep records pointed at the current addresses of local
 network interfaces.
 .
 Includes a systemd unit (installed disabled) and hooks for NetworkManager,
 networkd-dispatcher and dhclient. The hooks do nothing until
 /etc/updatedns.ini exists.
